[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3961.029, "timestamp": "01:06:01", "text": "有点像，呃，是，是，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3963.349, "timestamp": "01:06:03", "text": "这也是很大程度上人为的错误，就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3966.23, "timestamp": "01:06:06", "text": "与大多数自然事物一样。但还有 panas"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3968.23, "timestamp": "01:06:08", "text": "他们的生存能力实在太差了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3970.63, "timestamp": "01:06:10", "text": "总之。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3979.43, "timestamp": "01:06:19", "text": "真美。你正在做的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3981.99, "timestamp": "01:06:21", "text": "干得好。我甚至不知道自己到底是什么。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3985.349, "timestamp": "01:06:25", "text": "正在做。太疯狂了。是的，你把你删除了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3992.63, "timestamp": "01:06:32", "text": "感觉就像是我在玩游戏一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3995.109, "timestamp": "01:06:35", "text": "大约。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3999.67, "timestamp": "01:06:39", "text": "但他已经走了。他现在很穷。他很穷。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4009.829, "timestamp": "01:06:49", "text": "没关系，乔。没关系。我们 我们 我们会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4017.43, "timestamp": "01:06:57", "text": "我不想我也哦，是的。我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4019.75, "timestamp": "01:06:59", "text": "给你看看我画的东西，就像我的"}]